  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nAnswers open question 1 of [#2836](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2836) in the five-source common-B mutable-source alphabet of [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898): do non-distinct (one-repeat) label layers inside a transfer-coupled `(5,1,1)` schedule improve on distinct-label `R=84`?\n\n| Layer | Covering pairs | Exact min R | Tariff at X=0,C=1 | Undercuts 436? | Beats distinct 84? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|---|\n| Distinct-label (#2836 / #2817) | 8749440 | **84** | \u2265439 (needs X\u22652) | no | \u2014 |\n| Prefix-internal double | **2499840** | **98** | **463** | **no** | **no** |\n| Suffix\u2013prefix collision | **1666560** | **96** | **459** | **no** | **no** |\n| Combined one-repeat | **4166400** | **96** | **459** | **no** | **no** |\n\nEvery covering one-repeat dual has `R\u2208{96,98}`. Combined minimum is `R=96`, strictly worse than the distinct-label floor `84`. Abstract tariff `38\u00b77+2\u00b796+1=459>436` already at `X=0`.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2840) / [#2836](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2836) / [#2817](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2817) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q/`.\nTip: `90d879d143f9570c140d105a5cc60f445766d852`.\n\nExact: combined one-repeat min R **96** (tariff floor **459**); no undercut of 436; does not beat distinct-label 84.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_ONEREPEAT_7Q_OBSTRUCTION combined_min_R=96 ... tariff_floor=459 ... answers_all_shapes_oq1_onerepeat no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_TRANSFER_COUPLED_ONEREPEAT_7Q ... tariff_floor=459 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_ONEREPEAT_7Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/transfer-coupled-onerepeat-7q outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes. Requires `gcc` for local `dual.c` (Python fallback available).\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2836](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2836) (OQ1), [#2817](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2817). Freestanding one-repeat layer; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2836 / #2817 / #2779 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
